{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜多雲有一兩陣雨　星期三又降溫至約16度\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261123-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋華南及南海北部。</p><p>本港今日(11月23日)天氣預測，多雲，有一兩陣雨。日間氣溫徘徊在23度左右。吹和緩偏東風，初時風勢清勁，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望明日轉吹偏北風，天氣轉涼，初時雨勢較為頻密。星期三及星期四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:44:11.514972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:19:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T21:14:29.739977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:37:42.878758+00:00","content_hash":"3215cbd9d153bd405ce18e3c33c272eb314d2da5d23e737184aa5bf70b4404ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:44:11.514972+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}